      "text": [
        "5919 - وَ قَالَ أَمِيرُ اَلْمُؤْمِنِينَ عَلَيْهِ اَلسَّلاَمُ \"قَالَ رَسُولُ اَللَّهِ صَلَّى اَللَّهُ عَلَيْهِ وَ آلِهِ : \"اَللَّهُمَّ اِرْحَمْ خُلَفَائِي\" قِيلَ يَا رَسُولَ اَللَّهِ وَ مَنْ خُلَفَاؤُكَ قَالَ \"اَلَّذِينَ يَأْتُونَ مِنْ بَعْدِي يَرْوُونَ حَدِيثِي وَ سُنَّتِي \" \"."
      ],
      "translations": {
        "en.bab-ul-qaim-publications": [
          "Hadith.5919 - Commander of the Faithful Imam Ali ibn Abi Talib (as), peace be upon him, said:\nThe Messenger of Allah (swt), peace and blessings be upon him and his family, said:\n\"O' Allah (swt), have mercy on my successors.\"\nIt was asked: \"O' Messenger of Allah (swt), who are your successors?\"\nProphet (sw) replied: \"Those who come after me and narrate my traditions and my Sunnah.\""
        ]
      }
    },
